flowchart TD
    Start([Loan Application Started])

    Profile[Profile & OTP Completed]
    KYC[KYC Verified]
    Income[Income & Employment Verified]
    Bureau[Bureau Check Passed]
    Eligibility[Eligibility Calculated]
    Offer[Loan Offer Generated]
    Accept[Offer Accepted by Customer]
    Sanction[Loan Sanctioned & eSign Completed]
    NACH[NACH Mandate Setup]
    Disburse[Loan Disbursed]
    End([Loan Active])

    Start --> Profile
    Profile --> KYC
    KYC --> Income
    Income --> Bureau
    Bureau --> Eligibility
    Eligibility --> Offer
    Offer --> Accept
    Accept --> Sanction
    Sanction --> NACH
    NACH --> Disburse
    Disburse --> End
